{
  "quest.52AC92FEEDB40F4F.quest_desc": [
    "Not everyone is a builder, and that's okay! Completing this quest grants one of five pre-built houses that you can just slap down!",
    "",
    "This reward comes as a &aStructure Placer&r that builds the whole house in one go.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Hold it and look at the ground within 30 blocks to see where it'll go, then right-click to build it. The hint on screen lists the keys to anchor, rotate, and nudge it.",
    "",
    "Every block of the house needs air or something replaceable like grass where it goes. If a tree or a hill is in the way, you get an Invalid placement area message and nothing gets built, so find a flat, clear spot first.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&lCozy Cottage&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/classic-20260928-160754.png width:180 height:100 align:center fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&lArcane Hut&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/magic-20260928-160907.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&lNano Nook&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/tech-20260928-160936.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&lThe Shire&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/hobbit-20260928-160829.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&lThe Watch&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/tower-20260928-160948.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
  ],
  "quest.01583CD13DE25A1C.title": "&6Hephaestus Forge&r",
  "quest.65457E1A8AAEDF51.quest_desc": [
    "Did you know that your character is strong enough to break a thick tree with just your fist?",
    "",
    "&oPunch that tree.&r",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"Modpacks come with tons of items to loot, so have a \", {\"text\": \"Backpack\", \"color\": \"green\"}, \" on us. You can equip it in a curio slot and press \", {\"keybind\": \"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.open_backpack\", \"color\": \"yellow\", \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Default: B\"}}, \" to open it without taking it off.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.795D11D12A8F53E2.title": "&bStorage and Resources",
  "task.01E9525916A38B8E.title": "Scanner Modules",
  "quest.2B396BAC38F76E44.title": "&dMagic Mods",
  "quest.65457E1A8AAEDF51.quest_subtitle": "Chop Chop",
  "quest.3242DFBF0D574B6E.title": "Starting EnderIO",
  "quest.6D79D4AAD0431D98.quest_desc": [
    "Getting an &aIron Pickaxe&r is when mining really starts to open up.",
    "",
    "&aTip&r: You'll need a ton of &eIron&r for most mods, so it's worth looking into setting up a &aSmeltery&r to get more out of your raw ores.",
  ],
  "quest.6D79D4AAD0431D98.title": "Iron Tools",
  "quest.7EFD51F029547AFF.title": "First Storage",
  "quest.0270ADB3945D2C1A.quest_desc": [
    "&eScannable&r adds a &aScanner&r that can help you see ores through the wall.",
    "",
    "Install a Scanner Module and hold right click to scan which highlights blocks or ores around you.",
    "",
    "This item needs power, and a &aPocket Generator&r is great to keep it charged!",
  ],
  "quest.4278C6A88AE6F6D4.title": "Making Alloys",
  "task.2CDF75AE6BB56973.title": "Basic Circuit",
  "quest.2B396BAC38F76E44.quest_desc": [
    "Maybe you like sparkly magical mods. Everyone needs a little magic in their life sometimes.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Ars Magica\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"3070FD15982582F5\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Ars Magica\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"EvilCraft\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"31FD9EA513E0D010\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open EvilCraft\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Neo Vitae\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"3EC0F38A5F8D01E2\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Neo Vitae\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Occultism\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"10F792474C01A594\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Occultism\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Reliquary\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"71F0A28C67E53A01\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Reliquary\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Roots\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"276D73B7CB872EB4\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Roots\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Witchery\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"720DB36A13C6BBDC\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Witchery\"}}]",
  ],
  "quest.4A892B55276CEEE3.title": "Diamond In The Rough",
  "quest.209C086AC37B0B44.quest_desc": [
    "&6FTB Evolution 2&r has events that occasionally affect the world around you.",
    "",
    "You can use the &b/events toggle ftb:[event_name]&r to disable or re-enable each event as you please.",
    "",
    "&3Allay&r: A helpful allay will appear, offering to trade one item for another.",
    "",
    "&3Goat&r: A goat will appear and attempt to headbutt you before dropping a small reward.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&3Frogs&r: Spawns Frogs and Squids in nearby water.",
    "",
    "&3Fairy&r: This benevolent invisible sprite provides a little boost before it moves on.",
    "",
    "&3Trader&r: One of the many traders from the Wanderer guild pays a visit, offering various items to help in your adventures.",
    "",
    "&3Phantom&r: At night, spawns a glowing phantom that attempts to drop an anvil on your head. Thankfully it's not very accurate.",
    "",
    "&3Gunslinger&r: Carry a gun in your hotbar and a gunslinger may challenge you to a duel. Wait for the countdown and DRAW before firing. Win for bullets and coins.",
  ],
  "task.0F1858239A75514D.title": "Starter Generators",
  "task.3C60E5FEF7533AAB.title": "Alloy Machines",
  "quest.30BAA2AC524A2ACD.title": "Food, but Good.",
  "quest.65457E1A8AAEDF51.title": "Starting From Scratch",
  "quest.6DD06EC00EE795D9.quest_desc": [
    "For exploring, fighting and everything you do out in the world:",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Exploration\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"7F209ECB076B2B30\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Exploration\"}}, \": structures, biomes, bosses and every shopkeeper.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Gearing Up\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"37F99696A47264FD\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Gearing Up\"}}, \": Apotheosis gear, enchanting and trinkets.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Ice and Fire\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"199022E0BC1A489E\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Ice and Fire\"}}, \": dragons and the gear made from them.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Bounty Board\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"20D7DA6055C540FA\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Bounty Board\"}}, \": repeatable kill and playtime bounties.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Auroral\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"780B8C00D01127EB\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Auroral\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Resonance\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"4A4DCCA388BB4131\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Resonance\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Cooking and Brewing\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"7D090A60681CC97D\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Cooking and Brewing\"}}, \": food and drink.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Productive Farming\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"33F929B0D52A951D\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Productive Farming\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Building and Decoration\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"377E6E387004CA7E\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Building and Decoration\"}}, \": decorative blocks.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.4C4B66375F395436.quest_desc": [
    "A bonded spirit improves in two separate ways, and both start the moment you bond.",
    "",
    "Reach bond level 5 with your spirit. That is when its special ability switches on.",
    "",
    "- &3Bond&r: your spirit earns a point every second it is out within 32 blocks of you, and nothing while you are away from the keyboard. Feeding it its taming item gives a boost, once every ten minutes. Bond goes up to 30 and also speeds up leveling, opens more storage slots and shortens the wait to revive it.",
    "- &3Level&r: your spirit gets half of the experience you earn while it is nearby. Each level up to 30 raises its health, attack, armor and speed, and at 30 it can prestige for a star, up to five.",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: once bond is above 10, every death drops your spirit back a bond level. Use the charm to bring it back.",
  ],
  "quest.25B2D69A3A827D18.title": "&dA Spirit of Your Own",
  "quest.7EFD51F029547AFF.quest_desc": [
    "&aChests&r are great for storing your items at first, but this is modded. Chests can be upgraded in the world to store way more by using &eSophisticated Storage&r.",
    "",
    "A &aBasic Tier Upgrade&r used on a placed chest turns it into a &eSophisticated Storage&r chest with everything still inside, and further tier upgrades take it from copper up to netherite the same way.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Sophisticated Storage\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"3ACF3359B3B59A05\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Sophisticated Storage\"}}, \" in General Storage covers the tiers and upgrades.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.52243EEF2C055424.quest_desc": [
    "&eJust Dire Things&r changes blocks by placing them next to goo, and its first tier turns iron into Ferricore, a tougher metal than plain iron.",
    "",
    "Craft a &aPrimogel Goo&r and put it down. Its first job is making &aRaw Ferricore&r, which smelts into Ferricore Ingots.",
    "",
    "Placed goo starts out inactive, so use &2Rotten Flesh&r on it to wake it up (&7Sugar&r works too). Then put an &2Iron Block&r against any side, and after a while it turns into Raw Ferricore Ore. Mining that drops 3 or 4 &aRaw Ferricore&r.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: After each block it converts, the goo has a 10% chance to go inactive again. A conversion already in progress still finishes, but nothing new starts until you feed it again.",
  ],
  "quest.3BDC1484FE89DE9D.title": "Fuel For Launch",
  "quest.30BAA2AC524A2ACD.quest_subtitle": "Read it as goo-d.",
  "quest.1DD27C056EB93771.quest_desc": [
    "If you enjoy machinery and making factories, it's worth checking these chapters out.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Colossal Reactors\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"4E45AACCDF8A2570\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Colossal Reactors\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"EnderIO\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"566EEDD0B029090D\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open EnderIO\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Energized Power\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"196DBB74F9A47B69\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Energized Power\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Hephaestus\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"5DCA31CA513EF27C\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Hephaestus\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Industrial Contraptions\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"06E0165E2CC70DC3\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Industrial Contraptions\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Integrated Dynamics\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"5B34FEF756C93961\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Integrated Dynamics\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Just Dire Things\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"565AF0E2D4AB41BE\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Just Dire Things\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"LTX Industries\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"359C9BCF250CA832\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open LTX Industries\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Modular Force Field\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"1A1161EF6276767F\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Modular Force Field\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Nautec\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"77FFEC3A2289F5C2\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Nautec\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Oritech\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"33E4C81B762892B2\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Oritech\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Powah\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"659B9311FB49C425\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Powah\"}}]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Stellaris\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"6EB0B9691B5A733B\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Stellaris\"}}]",
  ],
  "quest.3BDC1484FE89DE9D.quest_desc": [
    "The &6FTB Skyline&r recipe won't start until the Fabricator holds 10,000 mB of &2Rocket Fuel&r.",
    "",
    "Build a &aVAT&r and ferment your first &2Rocket Fuel&r. It is the only fluid the Skyline asks for.",
    "",
    "The &aVAT&r ferments water into &2Hootch&r first, then turns the Hootch into Rocket Fuel. Every 1,000 mB of water only gives 250 mB of Hootch, so 10,000 mB of Rocket Fuel starts as 40,000 mB of water.",
  ],
  "quest.52AC92FEEDB40F4F.title": "Starter Houses",
  "quest.795D11D12A8F53E2.quest_desc": [
    "These five chapters cover the systems almost every base needs.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"General Storage\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"049DE43A1B31C38F\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open General Storage\"}}, \": backpacks, chests and digital storage.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Generating Resources\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"234A09F196E91BDD\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Generating Resources\"}}, \": bees, Mystical Agriculture and mob farms.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Logistics\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"64E34B2DA32D3586\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Logistics\"}}, \": moving items, fluids and power around.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Power Generation\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"754048401D3A6A7B\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Power Generation\"}}, \": your first generators.\"]",
    "[\"\", \"- \", {\"text\": \"Utilities\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"54FE9DA77DED738D\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Utilities\"}}, \": handy tools and gadgets.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.1F42537BFD6A6F33.title": "Starting Power",
  "quest.37BE5ED4CC6DCAB5.title": "&6FTB Skyline",
  "task.0EDC849E2DE1FC29.title": "FTB Events",
  "quest.1DD27C056EB93771.title": "&cTech Mods",
  "task.785029107A287E3E.title": "All In One Foods",
  "task.576DCD301F8DCDB0.title": "Any Coal",
  "task.310FCC3B1073BCE6.title": "Pressing Machines",
  "quest.6DD06EC00EE795D9.title": "&aAdventure",
  "quest.4C4B66375F395436.title": "&dGrowing Together",
  "task.1F103F09B7944A39.title": "Starter Houses",
  "quest.3CF1870586E420DB.title": "Crystal Clear",
  "quest.14510C717D3834C1.title": "Visit The &cNether&r",
  "quest.25B2D69A3A827D18.quest_desc": [
    "&eKindred Spirits&r gives you a companion that fights beside you, carries some of your items and gets stronger the longer you travel together. Start early, because the bond only grows with time.",
    "",
    "Craft a &aKindred Charm&r, then pick one of three spirit spawn eggs from the reward.",
    "",
    "The spirit from this egg hatches already tamed to you, so you can skip finding and taming one for your first companion.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Sneak and use the &aKindred Charm&r on it to bond. Taming alone only gives you a pet. The bond is what turns on levels, abilities and bringing it back after it dies. Use the charm on its own to open the bond screen, where you summon it, send it to rest, rename it and give orders.",
    "",
    "Four more spirits can be found in the world. They are the T-Rex, Baby Dragon, Gremlin and Mini Player. Hold Alt over the &aKindred Charm&r for its &2Oracle Index&r guide, which says where to find each spirit and how to tame it. The &6Gearing Up&r chapter covers each one and its gear.",
  ],
  "quest.1F42537BFD6A6F33.quest_desc": [
    "Once you have &cRedstone&r, you'll be able to get started making power!",
    "",
    "Your first machines need power, and any one of these starter generators will run them.",
    "",
    "Most of these generates will burn fuel to generate power. If you want to try something new and unique, try &aHorse Powered&r and have a Horse generate power for you!",
    "",
    "Or a Shop Keeper.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Power Generation\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"754048401D3A6A7B\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Power Generation\"}}, \" covers what to build after these.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.0270ADB3945D2C1A.title": "Scanning For Ores",
  "quest.3CF1870586E420DB.quest_desc": [
    "&aNether Quartz&r ore only generates in the Nether, so it's the first thing to look for once you're through the portal.",
    "",
    "Mine some &aNether Quartz&r and smelt it into a &2Silicon Gem&r. &aSilicon Gems&r are perfect for creating circuitry needed for complex machines.",
    "",
    "If you've started &eApplied Energistics 2&r, &aCertus Quartz Dust&r also smelts into the same &2Silicon Gem&r.",
  ],
  "quest.21246763BADC28E0.title": "Starting Tech",
  "quest.21246763BADC28E0.quest_desc": [
    "The &6FTB Fabricator&r needs a basic circuit, and three different mods make one that counts.",
    "",
    "Make any one of these:",
    "- &aElectronic Circuit&r from &eFTB Industrial Contraptions&r.",
    "",
    "- &2Basic Circuit&r from &eEnergized Power&r.",
    "",
    "- &aBasic Circuit&r from &eLTX Industries&r.",
  ],
  "quest.62A6EDE3018075BC.title": "Rocking Out",
  "quest.30BAA2AC524A2ACD.quest_desc": [
    "Food in this pack does more than fill your hunger bar. &eNutritional&r tracks how much fruit, grain, protein, vegetable, and dairy you eat, and each of those five groups drains a little as you get hungry.",
    "",
    "[\"Open the Nutrition screen with \", {\"keybind\": \"key.nutritional.open_nutrition\", \"color\": \"yellow\", \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Default: N\"}}, \" to see where you stand. A food's tooltip lists the groups it fills.\"]",
    "",
    "In this pack, a poor diet never hurts you. Nutrition only &6adds bonuses&r, so you can ignore it at first and work on it whenever you like.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Bake a &aPumpkin Pie&r. It fills &bFruit&r, &bGrain&r and &bVegetable&r at once, which makes it a good place to start.",
    "",
    "Two more foods and every group is covered:",
    "- &2Cooked meat or fish&r: &bProtein&r.",
    "- &2Milk Bucket&r: &bDairy&r, counted when you drink it.",
    "",
    "[\"These are only a starting point, and there are much better meals to find. A Burger or a Pepperoni Pizza from the \", {\"text\": \"Pantry for Blockheads\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"5DBBF2E8AEFB4149\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to Pantry for Blockheads Quest\"}}, \" quest fills four groups at once.\"]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Keep every group high and you earn bonuses:",
    "",
    "- &3Nourished&r: average 60 or more with no group under 40. +1 heart, and your groups drain 10% slower.",
    "- &3Gourmand&r: average 85 or more with no group under 70. +2 hearts, food fills your groups 10% more, and they drain 20% slower. It replaces Nourished.",
    "",
    "- &3Healthy Lifestyle&r: once you have played 7 in-game days, being Nourished or better earns another +2 hearts, kept until your average falls below 30.",
    "",
    "- &3Strength&r: whenever your &bProtein&r is 85 or more.",
  ],
  "quest.14510C717D3834C1.quest_desc": [
    "With a &2Diamond Pickaxe&r, you can finally mine &aObsidian&r, and that opens the way to the &cNether&r!",
    "",
    "Build a hollow rectangle at least 4 blocks wide and 5 blocks tall, then light it with &aFlint and Steel&r to activate it.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The &cNether&r has ores the Overworld doesn't, like &bNether Quartz&r and &dAeternium&r.",
    "",
    "Every block you walk in the Nether covers 8 in the Overworld, so a second portal makes a fast shortcut.",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: Beds explode in the Nether. Don't try to sleep there unless you want to do some explosive mining.",
  ],
  "quest.52243EEF2C055424.title": "A Goo Start",
  "quest.30AD073D8434BE97.title": "Pressing Matters",
  "task.404A8C08A7390D9C.title": "Visit The &cNether&r",
  "quest.4A892B55276CEEE3.quest_desc": [
    "It's time to find some &bDiamonds&r and craft a &aDiamond Pickaxe&r. ",
    "",
    "&2Obsidian&r needs a diamond pickaxe or better, and that's what you need to build a &cNether Portal&r.",
    "",
    "Unless you're a speedrunner.",
  ],
  "quest.4278C6A88AE6F6D4.quest_desc": [
    "Steel is next. The &6FTB Skyline&r alone takes 32 Steel Plates, so you'll want a steady supply.",
    "",
    "Build an alloy machine and make a &aSteel Ingot&r. An alloy machine combines two or more materials into one, which a furnace can't do.",
    "",
    "The &2Alloy Furnace&r from &eEnergized Power&r burns fuel like a furnace, so it works before you have any power.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: in this pack the &eEnder IO&r &2Alloy Smelter&r makes steel from one iron and one coal. The Alloy Furnace uses three coal per ingot.",
  ],
  "quest.62A6EDE3018075BC.quest_desc": [
    "If you want to get your hands on metal, you'll need something to mine it. Wood just won't do.",
    "",
    "Holding &b`&r while you break a block will activate &bUltimine&r to veinmine up to 16 blocks at the start.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Ultimining\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"6E7A3D79BEA2B8D6\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Vein Mining\"}}, \" in Tips and Tricks covers the block limit and the hunger cost.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.37BE5ED4CC6DCAB5.quest_desc": [
    "The &6FTB Skyline&r is the main machine that you'll use to launch &cFTB Components&r to complete the pack.",
    "",
    "No matter what you choose to do next, you'll always be doing something that can contribute to a &cLaunch&r from the &6Skyline&r.",
    "",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"FTB Skyline\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"2905D04F590BAC36\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open FTB Skyline\"}}, \" in the Feed The Beast chapter lists what it takes.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.3242DFBF0D574B6E.quest_desc": [
    "&eEnder IO&r builds many of its machines around a &aVoid Chassis&r.",
    "",
    "Collect some &aGrains of Infinity&r and craft a &2Void Chassis&r. One chassis also goes into the &6FTB Fabricator&r.",
    "",
    "To get grains, light a fire on top of &2Bedrock&r in the Overworld. When the fire burns out it can drop them. Bedrock gives 1 to 3 grains 80% of the time.",
  ],
  "quest.01583CD13DE25A1C.quest_desc": [
    "The &aSmeltery&r from &eHephaestus&r is a multiblock of seared bricks that melts metal down and casts it into ingots and blocks.",
    "",
    "Raw ore melts into twice the metal a furnace would give, and it's the easiest way to make the alloys other mods ask for.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"The \", {\"text\": \"Hephaestus\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"5DCA31CA513EF27C\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open Hephaestus\"}}, \" chapter walks you through the build.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.30AD073D8434BE97.quest_desc": [
    "Your &6FTB Skyline&r needs 32 &aSteel Plates&r, plus two Overclocked Heat Vents, and each of those needs &2Enderium Plates&r.",
    "",
    "Make a &aSteel Plate&r and an &2Enderium Plate&r. With 32 plates to make, a pressing machine is worth building now.",
    "",
    "A &2Hammer&r from &eEnergized Power&r makes plates by hand, but it costs two ingots per plate. Every pressing machine makes one from a single ingot.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: the &2Alloy Furnace&r can't make Enderium Ingots. Use the &eEnder IO&r Alloy Smelter instead, and the one from &eFTB Industrial Contraptions&r works too.",
  ],
  "task.254E5075B2383654.title": "Wood Log",
}